WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.720
- You're from Iran, but
when did you move to the US?

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:03.840
It was when you were pretty young, right?

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.603
- Yeah. I was about three years old

00:00:05.603 --> 00:00:07.890
when we came here and yeah

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:11.850
I was born in Iran, like
post revolution Iran.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.360
My dad had to leave
shortly after I was born.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.291
And then my mom and I went to,

00:00:16.291 --> 00:00:18.450
we had to go to Germany for a year

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.270
while our immigration
papers were all sorted.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.580
And then I met my dad again

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.706
at the airport in LA when I was three.

00:00:24.706 --> 00:00:25.640
- Wow.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.420
That's incredibly difficult.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.580
- Wild. Yeah.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.390
And like, you know, I'm
sure a lot of immigrant kids

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:34.232
can relate to this

00:00:34.232 --> 00:00:35.930
but when your parents move here,

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.507
you're sort of assimilating

00:00:37.507 --> 00:00:40.282
to this new culture at
the same time they are.

00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:41.910
And you're the one in school.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.350
So a lot of times, like, you're the one

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.510
you feel like the parent teaching
them how things are done.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:49.731
Yeah. Like you have to
sit them down and be like,

00:00:49.731 --> 00:00:51.860
okay so there's this thing called prom.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:53.240
Like, I'm going to need a dress.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.330
I will be attending a
Benihana's beforehand

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:56.410
with my classmates,

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.207
like, let me walk you through this.

00:00:58.207 --> 00:01:01.310
Or like, my mom would make
these incredible meals

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.470
for me to send to school.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.120
But I'm like, I love you.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.741
Like, I will get absolutely annihilated

00:01:05.741 --> 00:01:08.418
if I bring a lamb stew to
an American high school.

00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:13.418
- Yeah I will end up
in a trash can (laughs)

